02:50.550 --> 02:53.160
So there's a reason it's hidden so you don't, you know

02:53.160 --> 02:54.240
you don't screw with it.

02:54.240 --> 02:55.920
So that's all I wanted to show you here.

02:55.920 --> 02:59.130
That folder will be located in every git repository

02:59.130 --> 03:00.090
you initialize.

